      "reading_order": 5,
      "text": "1. Discovery of isotopes led to contradiction of the\npostulate of Dalton’s atomic theory that atoms\nof the same element are alike in all aspects."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260317_18da70d8-38fc-4407-831c-8d2ad06d65ae_7_block_005",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 290.0,
