      "text": "Representation of the atom or nuclide $\\rightarrow_{20}X^{39}$.\nHence, the correct option is (d)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260317_18da70d8-38fc-4407-831c-8d2ad06d65ae_7_block_019",
